  "body": "This may not be a bug, it could be related to app support.\n\n(Anarlog)[https://github.com/fastrepl/anarlog] supports hosted models for summarization of minutes, and I wanted to switch to using Magpie to connect to OpenRouter, but I get this error when I try to use the gateway: \"This endpoint doesn't support API key verification. Use an authentication model-list endpoint\"\n\nCould it be that Anarlog is not supported?\n\n<img width=\"1362\" height=\"602\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa0c9bfa-6a23-4b14-9518-5b1f7e99b2a2\" />",
  "closed_by": null,
